<body>
  <header class=3D"app-header">
    <div class=3D"wrap">
      <h1>VA Secondary Claim Tracker</h1>
      <p>Track migraines and night-time urination secondary to PTSD (70%), =
keep CFR criteria handy, and prepare for your C&amp;P exams =E2=80=94 then =
export to Google Sheets and Docs.</p>
      <div class=3D"badge-row">
        <span class=3D"badge">Primary: PTSD 70%</span>
        <span class=3D"badge">Secondary: Migraines (DC 8100)</span>
        <span class=3D"badge">Secondary: Urinary frequency / nocturia (=C2=
=A7 4.115a)</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <nav class=3D"tabs" aria-label=3D"Sections">
    <div class=3D"wrap">
      <button type=3D"button" data-tab=3D"dashboard" aria-selected=3D"true"=
>Dashboard</button>
      <button type=3D"button" data-tab=3D"migraines">Migraine log</button>
      <button type=3D"button" data-tab=3D"nocturia">Nocturia log</button>
      <button type=3D"button" data-tab=3D"cfr">CFR reference</button>
      <button type=3D"button" data-tab=3D"cp">C&amp;P prep</button>
      <button type=3D"button" data-tab=3D"export">Google export</button>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <main class=3D"wrap">
    <!-- DASHBOARD -->
    <section id=3D"dashboard" class=3D"panel active">
      <div class=3D"callout warn">
        <strong>Not legal advice.</strong> This is a personal evidence orga=
nizer for self-filing under 38 CFR =C2=A7 3.310. Verify current rules on eC=
FR / VA.gov. Upload evidence to your claim file =E2=80=94 do not rely on th=
e examiner to submit your logs.
      </div>
      <div class=3D"grid-2">
        <div class=3D"card">
          <h2>Migraine snapshot</h2>
          <p class=3D"sub">Based on entries stored in this browser</p>
          <div class=3D"stat-grid">
            <div class=3D"stat">
              <div class=3D"k">Attacks logged</div>
              <div class=3D"v" id=3D"m-count">0</div>
            </div>
            <div class=3D"stat">
              <div class=3D"k">Prostrating / mo</div>
              <div class=3D"v" id=3D"m-prost-mo">=E2=80=94</div>
              <div class=3D"h">avg over last several months</div>
            </div>
            <div class=3D"stat navy">
              <div class=3D"k">Suggested DC 8100 lens</div>
              <div class=3D"v" id=3D"m-rating-hint" style=3D"font-size:1.1r=
em">Need data</div>
              <div class=3D"h" id=3D"m-rating-note">Log several months for =
a stable picture</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class=3D"muted" style=3D"font-size:0.88rem;margin:0">Hint is a=
 study aid from your log averages =E2=80=94 VA decides the rating from the =
whole record.</p>
        </div>
        <div class=3D"card">
          <h2>Nocturia snapshot</h2>
          <p class=3D"sub">Night awakenings to void</p>
          <div class=3D"stat-grid">
            <div class=3D"stat">
              <div class=3D"k">Nights logged</div>
              <div class=3D"v" id=3D"n-count">0</div>
            </div>
            <div class=3D"stat">
              <div class=3D"k">Avg wake-to-void</div>
              <div class=3D"v" id=3D"n-avg">=E2=80=94</div>
            </div>
            <div class=3D"stat navy">
              <div class=3D"k">=C2=A7 4.115a lens</div>
              <div class=3D"v" id=3D"n-rating-hint" style=3D"font-size:1.1r=
em">Need data</div>
              <div class=3D"h" id=3D"n-rating-note">2 =E2=86=92 10%; 3=E2=
=80=934 =E2=86=92 20%; 5+ =E2=86=92 40%</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class=3D"card" style=3D"margin-top:16px">
        <h2>Self-filing roadmap</h2>
        <p class=3D"sub">Keep this next to your Google Docs checklist</p>
        <ol>
          <li>Log migraines and night voids consistently (aim for several m=
onths).</li>
          <li>Get diagnoses into medical records if not already there.</li>
          <li>Write personal statements (templates in <code>docs/04</code>)=
.</li>
          <li>Collect buddy statements; optionally request a nexus letter a=
ddressing cause <em>and</em> aggravation.</li>
          <li>File on VA.gov as secondary to PTSD; upload logs + statements=
.</li>
          <li>Use C&amp;P prep tab before exams; bring printed exports.</li=
>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- MIGRAINES -->
    <section id=3D"migraines" class=3D"panel">
      <div class=3D"grid-2">
        <div class=3D"card">
          <h2>Log a migraine</h2>
          <p class=3D"sub">Capture what DC 8100 and the Headaches DBQ care =
about</p>
          <form id=3D"migraine-form">
            <div class=3D"row">
              <div>
                <label for=3D"m-date">Date</label>
                <input id=3D"m-date" type=3D"date" required=3D"">
              </div>
              <div>
                <label for=3D"m-severity">Severity (1=E2=80=9310)</label>
                <input id=3D"m-severity" type=3D"number" min=3D"1" max=3D"1=
0" value=3D"7" required=3D"">
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class=3D"row">
              <div>
                <label for=3D"m-start">Start time</label>
                <input id=3D"m-start" type=3D"time">
              </div>
              <div>
                <label for=3D"m-end">End time</label>
                <input id=3D"m-end" type=3D"time">
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class=3D"row">
              <div>
                <label for=3D"m-duration">Duration (hours)</label>
                <input id=3D"m-duration" type=3D"number" min=3D"0" step=3D"=
0.25" placeholder=3D"e.g. 6">
              </div>
              <div>
                <label for=3D"m-location">Pain location</label>
                <select id=3D"m-location">
                  <option>Left side</option>
                  <option>Right side</option>
                  <option>Both sides</option>
                  <option>Other / varies</option>
                </select>
              </div>
            </div>
            <label>Associated symptoms</label>
            <div class=3D"checks">
              <label><input type=3D"checkbox" name=3D"msym" value=3D"Nausea=
"> Nausea</label>
              <label><input type=3D"checkbox" name=3D"msym" value=3D"Vomiti=
ng"> Vomiting</label>
              <label><input type=3D"checkbox" name=3D"msym" value=3D"Light =
sensitivity"> Light</label>
              <label><input type=3D"checkbox" name=3D"msym" value=3D"Sound =
sensitivity"> Sound</label>
              <label><input type=3D"checkbox" name=3D"msym" value=3D"Vision=
 changes"> Vision</label>
            </div>
            <div class=3D"row">
              <div>
                <label for=3D"m-prost">Characteristic prostrating?</label>
                <select id=3D"m-prost">
                  <option value=3D"Y">Yes =E2=80=94 stopped ordinary activi=
ty</option>
                  <option value=3D"N">No</option>
                </select>
              </div>
              <div>
                <label for=3D"m-complete">Completely prostrating &amp; prol=
onged?</label>
                <select id=3D"m-complete">
                  <option value=3D"N">No</option>
                  <option value=3D"Y">Yes</option>
                </select>
              </div>
            </div>
            <label for=3D"m-ptsd">PTSD / trigger notes</label>
            <textarea id=3D"m-ptsd" placeholder=3D"e.g. After nightmare; hi=
gh anxiety day; poor sleep"></textarea>
            <div class=3D"row">
              <div>
                <label for=3D"m-med">Medication taken</label>
                <input id=3D"m-med" placeholder=3D"e.g. sumatriptan 50mg">
              </div>
              <div>
                <label for=3D"m-relief">Relief</label>
                <select id=3D"m-relief">
                  <option>None</option>
                  <option>Partial</option>
                  <option>Full</option>
                </select>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class=3D"row">
              <div>
                <label for=3D"m-work">Missed work / activities?</label>
                <select id=3D"m-work">
                  <option value=3D"Y">Yes</option>
                  <option value=3D"N">No</option>
                </select>
              </div>
              <div>
                <label for=3D"m-impact">Work / life impact</label>
                <input id=3D"m-impact" placeholder=3D"Left work early; dark=
 room 4 hrs">
              </div>
            </div>
            <label for=3D"m-notes">Notes for C&amp;P</label>
            <textarea id=3D"m-notes" placeholder=3D"Anything you want to re=
member for the exam"></textarea>
            <div class=3D"actions">
              <button class=3D"btn" type=3D"submit">Save migraine</button>
              <button class=3D"btn secondary" type=3D"button" id=3D"export-=
migraines">Export CSV for Sheets</button>
            </div>
          </form>
        </div>
        <div class=3D"card">
          <h2>Recent migraine entries</h2>
          <p class=3D"sub">Stored locally in this browser</p>
          <div id=3D"migraine-list"><p class=3D"empty">No migraine entries =
yet. Log your next attack after it settles.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- NOCTURIA -->
    <section id=3D"nocturia" class=3D"panel">
      <div class=3D"grid-2">
        <div class=3D"card">
          <h2>Log a night</h2>
          <p class=3D"sub">Count awakenings to void =E2=80=94 the =C2=A7 4.=
115a key number</p>
          <form id=3D"nocturia-form">
            <div class=3D"row">
              <div>
                <label for=3D"n-date">Date (night of)</label>
                <input id=3D"n-date" type=3D"date" required=3D"">
              </div>
              <div>
                <label for=3D"n-bed">Bedtime</label>
                <input id=3D"n-bed" type=3D"time">
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class=3D"row">
              <div>
                <label for=3D"n-total">Total awakenings to void</label>
                <input id=3D"n-total" type=3D"number" min=3D"0" max=3D"20" =
value=3D"3" required=3D"">
              </div>
              <div>
                <label for=3D"n-day">Daytime void interval (hours)</label>
                <input id=3D"n-day" type=3D"number" min=3D"0" step=3D"0.25"=
 placeholder=3D"e.g. 1.5">
              </div>
            </div>
            <label for=3D"n-times">Wake times (optional, comma-separated)</=
label>
            <input id=3D"n-times" placeholder=3D"00:15, 02:10, 04:00, 05:45=
">
            <div class=3D"row">
              <div>
                <label for=3D"n-fluid">Fluid after 6pm</label>
                <select id=3D"n-fluid">
                  <option>Low</option>
                  <option>Moderate</option>
                  <option>High</option>
                </select>
              </div>
              <div>
                <label for=3D"n-sleep">Sleep quality impact (1=E2=80=9310, =
10=3Dworst)</label>
                <input id=3D"n-sleep" type=3D"number" min=3D"1" max=3D"10" =
value=3D"6">
              </div>
            </div>
            <label for=3D"n-ptsd">PTSD / medication notes</label>
            <textarea id=3D"n-ptsd" placeholder=3D"Nightmare then bathroom;=
 hard to fall back asleep; med X started=E2=80=A6"></textarea>
            <label for=3D"n-next">Next-day function impact</label>
            <textarea id=3D"n-next" placeholder=3D"Fatigue, irritability, w=
orse concentration=E2=80=A6"></textarea>
            <div class=3D"actions">
              <button class=3D"btn" type=3D"submit">Save night</button>
              <button class=3D"btn secondary" type=3D"button" id=3D"export-=
nocturia">Export CSV for Sheets</button>
            </div>
          </form>
        </div>
        <div class=3D"card">
          <h2>Recent nights</h2>
          <p class=3D"sub">Stored locally in this browser</p>
          <div id=3D"nocturia-list"><p class=3D"empty">No nights logged yet=
. Enter last night=E2=80=99s wake-to-void count.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CFR -->
    <section id=3D"cfr" class=3D"panel stack">
      <div class=3D"card">
        <h2>38 CFR =C2=A7 3.310 =E2=80=94 Secondary service connection</h2>
        <p class=3D"sub">Legal basis for both claims</p>
        <p>Disability proximately due to or the result of a service-connect=
ed disease or injury shall be service connected. You can win on <strong>cau=
sation</strong> and/or <strong>aggravation</strong>. Ask any nexus opinion =
to address both.</p>
      </div>
      <div class=3D"card">
        <h2>Migraines =E2=80=94 =C2=A7 4.124a DC 8100</h2>
        <table class=3D"cfr-table">
          <tbody><tr><th class=3D"pct">%</th><th>Criteria</th></tr>
          <tr><td class=3D"pct">50</td><td>Very frequent completely prostra=
ting and prolonged attacks productive of severe economic inadaptability</td=
></tr>
          <tr><td class=3D"pct">30</td><td>Characteristic prostrating attac=
ks averaging once a month over last several months</td></tr>
          <tr><td class=3D"pct">10</td><td>Characteristic prostrating attac=
ks averaging one in 2 months over last several months</td></tr>
          <tr><td class=3D"pct">0</td><td>Less frequent attacks</td></tr>
        </tbody></table>
        <p><strong>Prostrating (DBQ):</strong> extreme exhaustion, powerles=
sness, debilitation, or incapacitation with substantial inability to engage=
 in ordinary activities.</p>
      </div>
      <div class=3D"card">
        <h2>Urinary frequency / nocturia =E2=80=94 =C2=A7 4.115a</h2>
        <table class=3D"cfr-table">
          <tbody><tr><th class=3D"pct">%</th><th>Criteria</th></tr>
          <tr><td class=3D"pct">40</td><td>Daytime voiding &lt; 1 hour, <em=
>or</em> awakening to void <strong>5+ times</strong> per night</td></tr>
          <tr><td class=3D"pct">20</td><td>Daytime interval 1=E2=80=932 hou=
rs, <em>or</em> awakening <strong>3=E2=80=934 times</strong> per night</td>=
</tr>
          <tr><td class=3D"pct">10</td><td>Daytime interval 2=E2=80=933 hou=
rs, <em>or</em> awakening <strong>2 times</strong> per night</td></tr>
        </tbody></table>
      </div>
      <div class=3D"card">
        <h2>Nexus theories to document</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Migraines:</strong> PTSD stress/hyperarousal as trigg=
er or aggravator; sleep loss; flares coinciding with PTSD; literature linki=
ng PTSD and migraine disability.</li>
          <li><strong>Nocturia:</strong> hyperarousal/nightmares waking you=
; fragmented sleep; PTSD medication side effects; next-day worsening of PTS=
D from sleep loss.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class=3D"muted" style=3D"margin-bottom:0;font-size:0.88rem">Offi=
cial text: <a href=3D"https://www.ecfr.gov/current/title-38/section-3.310" =
target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noopener">=C2=A7 3.310</a>, <a href=3D"https://www=
.ecfr.gov/current/title-38/section-4.124a" target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noopene=
r">=C2=A7 4.124a</a>, <a href=3D"https://www.ecfr.gov/current/title-38/sect=
ion-4.115a" target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noopener">=C2=A7 4.115a</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- C&P PREP -->
    <section id=3D"cp" class=3D"panel stack">
      <div class=3D"card">
        <h2>C&amp;P exam prep =E2=80=94 your answers</h2>
        <p class=3D"sub">Saved in this browser. Copy into Google Docs befor=
e the exam.</p>
        <div class=3D"prep-q">
          <label for=3D"cp-m-timeline">Migraines: when did they start relat=
ive to PTSD?</label>
          <textarea id=3D"cp-m-timeline" data-cp=3D"mTimeline"></textarea>
        </div>
        <div class=3D"prep-q">
          <label for=3D"cp-m-freq">Average prostrating attacks per month (l=
ast several months)?</label>
          <textarea id=3D"cp-m-freq" data-cp=3D"mFreq"></textarea>
        </div>
        <div class=3D"prep-q">
          <label for=3D"cp-m-stop">What must you stop doing during an attac=
k?</label>
          <textarea id=3D"cp-m-stop" data-cp=3D"mStop"></textarea>
        </div>
        <div class=3D"prep-q">
          <label for=3D"cp-m-work">Work / economic impact examples?</label>
          <textarea id=3D"cp-m-work" data-cp=3D"mWork"></textarea>
        </div>
        <div class=3D"prep-q">
          <label for=3D"cp-n-count">Typical night void count over last seve=
ral months?</label>
          <textarea id=3D"cp-n-count" data-cp=3D"nCount"></textarea>
        </div>
        <div class=3D"prep-q">
          <label for=3D"cp-n-link">How PTSD / meds connect to night urinati=
on?</label>
          <textarea id=3D"cp-n-link" data-cp=3D"nLink"></textarea>
        </div>
        <div class=3D"prep-q">
          <label for=3D"cp-nexus">Nexus talking points (cause and aggravati=
on)</label>
          <textarea id=3D"cp-nexus" data-cp=3D"nexus"></textarea>
        </div>
        <div class=3D"actions">
          <button class=3D"btn" type=3D"button" id=3D"save-cp">Save prep an=
swers</button>
          <button class=3D"btn secondary" type=3D"button" id=3D"export-cp-d=
oc">Copy Docs-ready text</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class=3D"card">
        <h2>Day-of checklist</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Upload latest logs to VA.gov before the appointment.</li>
          <li>Bring printed migraine log, nocturia log, medication list, st=
atements.</li>
          <li>If symptom-free that day, say so =E2=80=94 then describe a ty=
pical attack from the log.</li>
          <li>Use counts, not =E2=80=9Coften.=E2=80=9D</li>
          <li>Describe interruptions of ordinary activity for prostrating a=
ttacks.</li>
          <li>Ask (politely) that aggravation be considered if causation is=
 doubted.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- EXPORT -->
    <section id=3D"export" class=3D"panel stack">
      <div class=3D"card">
        <h2>Import this kit into Google Drive</h2>
        <ol>
          <li>Create a Drive folder: <strong>VA Secondary Claims =E2=80=94 =
PTSD</strong>.</li>
          <li>Upload CSV files from <code>va-claim-kit/templates/</code> =
=E2=86=92 Open with Google Sheets.</li>
          <li>Upload HTML files from <code>va-claim-kit/docs/</code> =E2=86=
=92 Open with Google Docs.</li>
          <li>Or use the buttons below to download live logs from this trac=
ker and File =E2=86=92 Import into Sheets.</li>
        </ol>
        <div class=3D"actions">
          <button class=3D"btn" type=3D"button" id=3D"export-migraines-2">D=
ownload migraine CSV</button>
          <button class=3D"btn" type=3D"button" id=3D"export-nocturia-2">Do=
wnload nocturia CSV</button>
          <button class=3D"btn secondary" type=3D"button" id=3D"export-all-=
summary">Download summary for Docs</button>
          <button class=3D"btn ghost" type=3D"button" id=3D"print-packet">P=
rint C&amp;P packet</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class=3D"card">
        <h2>Docs paste preview</h2>
        <p class=3D"sub">Copy this into a Google Doc titled =E2=80=9CClaim =
evidence summary=E2=80=9D</p>
